flowchart TD
    A[New H1 bar] --> B{Friday >= 20:00?}
    B -- yes --> C[Close magic 140001 positions]
    B -- no --> D[Timeout existing position at 12 bars]
    C --> E[Stop]
    D --> F{Position already open?}
    F -- yes --> E
    F -- no --> G{Spread <= 80 points?}
    G -- no --> E
    G -- yes --> H{Hour = 13:00?}
    H -- no --> E
    H -- yes --> I[Build London range 07:00-11:00]
    I --> J{Range 8 to 32 dollars?}
    J -- no --> E
    J -- yes --> K[Compute midpoint and inspect 12:00 bar]
    K --> L{Bullish continuation conditions?}
    K --> M{Bearish continuation conditions?}
    L -- yes --> N[Buy Ask; SL below London low; TP 2R]
    M -- yes --> O[Sell Bid; SL above London high; TP 2R]
    L -- no --> E
    M -- no --> E
